70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, presence fluctuates, but a fixed rota with a shared pot keeps the monthly cost predictable. I need to see the exact split before I commit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I agree. Predictability is key. If I know exactly which week is mine, I can block that two hours in my schedule. Option C offers that control.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
